    {
      "pool_size": 25,
      "pool_returned": 25,
      "candidates": [
        {
          "entry_id": 2741,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.21878213,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact a",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2737,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.18120709,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n\nSome tests are done at the clinic during a regular appointment. This guide explains how to prepare for each of them. If your doctor has given you different instruc",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2735,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.17315984,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2744,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.16897157,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n\nYour itemized receipt lists each procedure done at your visit by its billing code. Medical procedures use five-digit CPT codes, and dental procedures use CDT cod",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2735,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.13819277,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "re not in-network with Blue Essentials HMO or Blue Advantage HMO plans, because those plans only cover care from their own medical groups.\n\n## Aetna\n\nWe are in-network with Aetna Choice POS II and Aet",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2732,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.13288888,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express),",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2733,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.13166423,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2738,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.12713568,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "ome vaccines need more than one dose or take time to become effective. Bring your travel dates and the list of countries you are visiting. We offer:\n\n- hepatitis A (Havrix): two doses six to twelve mo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2738,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.117902085,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n\n## Seasonal flu vaccine\n\nWe give the flu vaccine every year from the start of September until the end of March. Patients aged 65 and over are offered a high-dose vaccine (Fluzone High-",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2743,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.1155204,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "hree weeks apart. We do not remove skin tags, moles or other skin lesions for cosmetic reasons.\n\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medica",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2738,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.115491614,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "vaccine $35, high-dose flu vaccine $70, Tdap $55, hepatitis A $85 per dose, typhoid injection $90, oral typhoid course $95, hepatitis B $70 per dose. They are the price of the vaccine itself, and are ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2740,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.11513917,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2735,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.108495444,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " visit at check-in. The front desk can estimate that amount for you if you give them your plan details before the visit.\n\n## Updating your insurance\n\nIf your insurance has changed since your last visi",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2742,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.106229275,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who ha",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2729,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.105719596,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2740,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.10541458,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.\n\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank detai",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2735,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.10429993,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advantage plans from UnitedHealthcare are in-network when the plan is a PPO, and not in-network when it is an HMO.\n\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medic",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2743,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.10125208,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n\n## Annual physical examination\n\nAn annual physical is a preventive check-up for adults who feel well. It includes a review of your medical history and current medicines; y",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2743,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.09981969,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "r blood glucose readings to each review, and bring your inhalers if you have asthma or COPD, so the GP can check your technique.\n\n## Ear wax removal\n\nWe remove ear wax by microsuction, which uses a sm",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2737,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.09916349,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "have been asked to bring a urine sample, collect a sterile container from the front desk beforehand; household containers can contaminate the sample. Unless you were told otherwise, collect the first ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2741,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.09564529,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " your last name and date of birth. The kiosk cannot take payments: any copay or self-pay amount is paid at the front desk.\n\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more t",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2739,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.092373684,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.\n\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minut",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2727,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.091708645,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2737,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.08486008,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "try measures how much air you can breathe out, and how fast. You will blow hard into a mouthpiece several times while sitting down. Before the test:\n\n- do not use a short-acting reliever inhaler, such",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2728,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.084470324,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        }
      ],
